41. DETERMINISTIC EXECUTION
Where a validation rule is deterministic, identical inputs must produce identical results.
Conceptually:
same model
+
same code manifest
+
same rule versions
+
same engine versions
=
same validation result
This property is fundamental to reproducibility.

